OL,3,ABurundians rush to leave Kenya ahead of
OL,4,Acrackdown on unregistered traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of Burundians in Kenya are
OL,7,Fscrambling to process travel documents
OL,8,Fto leave the country ahead of the
OL,9,Fcrackdown on unlicensed small
OL,10,Fbusinesses run by migrants.
OL,12,FKenyan President William Ruto set
OL,13,FMonday as the deadline for foreigners
OL,14,Foperating small-scale businesses to
OL,15,Fcease work, after the trade ministry
OL,16,Fsaid some exploited visa rules to work
OL,17,Fwithout the required permits.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
